  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nDecoding signs:\n\n \n \n\n Sign\n P\n D\n S\n V\n \n \n\n Stands For\n +\n -\n ×\n ÷\n \n \n\nGiven: (96 V 8 P 50 D 12 S 4 P 6) D (50 V 5 S 3 D 8 S 3) = ?\n\n(96 V 8 P 50 D 12 S 4 P 6) D (50 V 5 S 3 D 8 S 3) = ? ⇒ (96 ÷ 8 + 50 - 12 × 4 + 6) - (50 ÷ 5 × 3 - 8 × 3) = ?\n\n⇒ (__**96 **____**÷**____** 8**__ + 50 - 12 × 4 + 6) - (__**50 **____**÷**____** 5**__ × 3 - 8 × 3) = ?\n\n⇒ (12 + 50 - __**12 **____**×**____** 4**__ + 6) - (__**10**____** ×**____** 3**__ - __**8 **____**×**____** 3**__) = ?\n\n⇒ (__**12**____** + 50 + 6**__ - 48) - __**(30**____** - 24**____**)**__ = ?\n\n⇒ __**(68 - 48**____**)**__ - 6 = ?\n\n⇒ __**20**____** - 6**__ = ?\n\n⇒ 14 = ?\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
